      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable to feel exhausted by the advice to \"just get help\" when the issue is a deep, existential dread that no conversation can resolve. The feeling that a life without purpose, soul, or a higher power is just a biological accident can feel like a profound and hopeless joke.\n\nPlease know that this \"nothingness\" is a very human and common human experience, not a personal failure on your part. Even when we despair to the end, a meaningful life is still a struggle to find light in the darkness and a chance to make your own sense of meaning.",
